### **Specification References**

- **3GPP TS 33.501 v17.6.0 (Security architecture and procedures for 5G System)**
  - **Section 6.4.3**: Ciphering algorithms
    > "NEA0 shall not be used for normal operation."
  - **Section 6.4.4**: Integrity algorithms
    > "NIA0 shall not be used unless explicitly required for testing or emergency fallback."
  - **Section 6.5.2**: Integrity protection for DRBs
