|--------------|-----------|
| **NEA0 as preferred ciphering** | **No encryption** → **eavesdropping**, **data leakage**, **MITM attacks**. |
| **NIA0 in integrity list** | **No integrity** → **message forgery**, **replay attacks**, **undetected tampering**. |
| **DRB integrity disabled** | **User plane data tampering** → **data corruption**, **session hijacking**, **fraud**. |

> **Overall Risk**: **Critical**. These violations expose the 5G network to **passive and active attacks**, violating **3GPP and O-RAN security baselines**.

